# Vercel Web Analytics Configuration Report

## Summary
Vercel Web Analytics has been successfully verified and confirmed to be properly installed and configured in this Next.js project.

## Current Implementation Status

### ✅ Package Installation
- **Package**: `@vercel/analytics` version `2.0.1`
- **Status**: Already installed in `package.json` dependencies
- **Location**: `client/package.json`

### ✅ Configuration
- **Framework**: Next.js 16.2.4 (App Router)
- **Implementation**: Analytics component properly configured in root layout
- **Location**: `client/app/layout.tsx`
  - Line 9: Import statement `import { Analytics } from '@vercel/analytics/next';`
  - Line 122: Component rendered `<Analytics />`

### Implementation Details
Following the official Vercel documentation (https://vercel.com/docs/analytics/quickstart), the Analytics component is:
1. Imported from `@vercel/analytics/next` (Next.js-specific package)
2. Added to the root layout at `app/layout.tsx`
3. Placed inside the `<body>` tag after all other content
4. This ensures analytics tracking on all pages in the application

