## Next Steps for Project Owner
To complete the Vercel Web Analytics setup:

1. **Enable Analytics in Vercel Dashboard**:
   - Log in to your Vercel account
   - Navigate to your project
   - Select "Analytics" in the sidebar
   - Click "Enable" button

2. **Deploy to Vercel**:
   - Run `vercel deploy` or push to your connected Git repository
   - Vercel will automatically build and deploy with analytics enabled

3. **Verify Analytics is Working**:
   - Visit your deployed site
   - Open browser Developer Tools → Network tab
   - Look for requests to `/_vercel/insights/` or similar paths
   - After some traffic, view data in your Vercel dashboard's Analytics section

## Notes
- The implementation follows Next.js App Router best practices
- Analytics component is placed at the root level to track all pages
- No additional configuration or code changes were needed
- The setup is production-ready and will work once deployed to Vercel

